{"2873440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chrono Odyssey", "steam_appid": 2873440, "required_age": "18", "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873440/extras/270cecaf100e9d92a315b5f60637ad43.avif?t=1762754134\" width=792 height=174 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873440/extras/72b632b21244a973331c58df95e754b3.avif?t=1762754134\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873440/extras_big/72b632b21244a973331c58df95e754b3.avif?t=1762754134 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chrono Odyssey, A Next-generation Action MMORPG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features include awe-inspiring visuals powered by Unreal Engine 5, a vast and intricately designed seamless open world, dynamic action-based combat mechanics based on time manipulation and extensive customization. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Open World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seamless and unrestricted exploration of any terrain is offered by Chrono Odyssey thanks to its open world concept. It also features many different biomes, including grasslands, snowlands, swamps, and more. The adventure through the world of Chrono Odyssey offers much to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873440/extras/dd850b92f618d4b4b6528838c8f08609.avif?t=1762754134\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873440/extras_big/dd850b92f618d4b4b6528838c8f08609.avif?t=1762754134 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chronotector</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A “Chronotector” is an artifact which allows players to stop time around monsters or rewind a character's time, enabling more dynamic combat. You can explore past generations of the open world before environmental and historical events made sweeping changes to the land of Chrono Odyssey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeons &amp; Raiding</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party up and clear a variety of dungeons! Chrono Odyssey’s end content features challenging dungeons and raids. If you’re strong enough, you might even be able to clear these formidable dungeons and raids on your own. You can also look forward to getting rewards for clearing dungeons, group dungeons, and PvP content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873440/extras/73250900c072759c8d8224f8ac2e0350.avif?t=1762754134\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873440/extras_big/73250900c072759c8d8224f8ac2e0350.avif?t=1762754134 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Harvesting and Crafting</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress and improve the in-game economy by participating in lucrative activities within Chrono Odyssey's vast open world. This includes harvesting, logging, mining, and skinning. You can craft valuable equipment and consumables by acquiring resources from these activities. Additionally, these gameplay elements will foster social interaction and a sense of community, as you engage in trade and collaboration with other players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character and express your individuality. Characters can be personalized with a wide range of options, including gender, body types, facial features, hairstyles, makeup, scars, and much more - all up to your unique preferences with a high degree of freedom.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873440/extras/72b632b21244a973331c58df95e754b3.avif?t=1762754134\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873440/extras_big/72b632b21244a973331c58df95e754b3.avif?t=1762754134 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chrono Odyssey, A Next-generation Action MMORPG</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features include awe-inspiring visuals powered by Unreal Engine 5, a vast and intricately designed seamless open world, dynamic action-based combat mechanics based on time manipulation and extensive customization. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Open World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A seamless and unrestricted exploration of any terrain is offered by Chrono Odyssey thanks to its open world concept. It also features many different biomes, including grasslands, snowlands, swamps, and more. The adventure through the world of Chrono Odyssey offers much to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873440/extras/dd850b92f618d4b4b6528838c8f08609.avif?t=1762754134\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873440/extras_big/dd850b92f618d4b4b6528838c8f08609.avif?t=1762754134 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chronotector</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap